# Build context for `Dockerfile.docs` ONLY.
#
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to `.dockerignore`
# when it exists. There is no root `.dockerignore` here — this repo has no app
# image — so without this file the whole checkout (integration sources, logs,
# tooling caches) would be uploaded to build a static site that needs four paths.
#
# If a builder ever ignores this file, the docs build still succeeds; it is a
# context-size optimisation, not a correctness requirement.
*

!mkdocs.yml
!docs
!docs/**
!docker/docs.Caddyfile
!docker/docs-entrypoint.sh
